{A.A.1 = 1-8}
A.A.1.	While I, the lady, 
A.A.2.	was passing the day yesterday, while I, 
A.A.3.	@wDN{Inana}, was passing the day yesterday, 
A.A.4.	while I was passing the day, while I was dancing, 
A.A.5.	while I was singing songs all day until evening, he met me, 
A.A.6.	he met me. The lord, 
A.A.7.	the friend of @wDN{An}, met me; 
A.A.8.	the lord took me in his hands, @wDN{Ušumgal-ana} embraced me about my neck. 

{A.A.9 = 9-12}
A.A.9.	@q[Inana,Dumuzid]{“……, let me go, 
A.A.10.	so that I can go to our house! Friend of @wDN{Enlil}, 
A.A.11.	let me go, so that I can go to our house! 
A.A.12.	What lie can I offer to my mother? What lie can I offer to my mother @wDN{Ningal}?”} 

{A.A.13 = 13-22}
A.A.13.	@q[Dumuzid,Inana]{“Let me teach you, let me teach you! @wDN{Inana}, 
A.A.14.	let me teach you the lies of women: 
A.A.15.	@q{“My girlfriend was dancing with me in the square. 
A.A.16.	She ran around playfully with me, banging the drum. 
A.A.17.	She sang her sweet songs for me. 
A.A.18.	I passed the day there with her in pleasure and delight.”} 
A.A.19.	Offer this as a lie to your own mother. 
A.A.20.	As for us -- let me make love with you by moonlight! 
A.A.21.	Let me loosen your hairgrip on the holy and luxuriant couch. 
A.A.22.	May you pass a sweet day there with me in voluptuous pleasure.”} 

{A.A.23 = 23}
A.A.23.	@fsux{Sa-gida}. 

{A.B.24 = 24-26}
A.B.24.	@q[Inana,Dumuzid]{“I the maiden, in the streets and alleys, 
A.B.25.	……, by day I …… with you,”} 
