B.B.3.	There he is, standing at our mother's gate, 
B.B.4.	while I am rushing around in excitement. 
B.B.5.	There he is standing at @wDN{Ningal's} gate, 
B.B.6.	while I am rushing around in excitement. 
B.B.7.	Oh that someone would tell my mother! 
B.B.8.	May our neighbour come to sprinkle water on the floor! 
B.B.9.	Oh that someone would tell my mother @wDN{Ningal}! 
B.B.10.	May our neighbour come to sprinkle water on the floor: 
B.B.11.	the fragrance of her dwelling is pleasant, 
B.B.12.	and her words are delightful. 

{B.B.13 = 13-20}
B.B.13.	My lord is perfect for the holy embrace. 
B.B.14.	@wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana}, the son-in-law of @wDN{Suen}, Lord @wDN{Dumuzid}, 
B.B.15.	is perfect for the holy embrace. @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana}, 
B.B.16.	son-in-law of @wDN{Suen}, my lord: how pleasing is your lavishness, 
B.B.17.	and how sweet-tasting are your green plants from the plain! 
B.B.18.	@wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana}, 
B.B.19.	how pleasing is your lavishness, 
B.B.20.	and how sweet-tasting are your green plants from the plain! 

{B.B.21 = 21}
B.B.21.	@fsux{Sa-ŋara}. 

{B.B.22 = 22}
